      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOLO MAN (1) turned in a better effort at Murray Bridge last start, finishing second behind Sorella (25.77) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Top chance in this line up. WATCH AND SEE (3) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (19.84) last time out at Angle Park. Is yet to taste defeat at this course and distance. Expected to be in this for a long way. EL REY (5) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Murray Bridge in a handy 19.32 beating Black Noir. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Likely to be in the finish. GINNY'S RUN (7) is new to this circuit but not to be underestimated.",
